[38;5;231m⏺[39m Added to [38;5;153mindex.html[39m:

  - A [38;5;153m<label class="task">[39m wrapping a native [38;5;153m<input type="checkbox">[39m and the item text. Wrapping in the label makes the
    text clickable too, and the browser handles the on/off state — no JS needed.
  - One CSS rule striking through the text when checked, so "done" is visible.

  One item is hardcoded as an example. If you want a list of items, or the checked state to survive a reload
  (localStorage), say the word — both are small additions but neither was in the ask.

  Not verified: I didn't open the page in a browser. There are no tests or build in this repo to run.

